{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>警方聯同入境處昨日（16日）打擊非法賣淫活動。元朗警區特別職務隊共拘捕28名內地女子，年齡介乎17至48歲，涉嫌違反逗留條件，所有被捕女子現正被扣留調查，警方強調會繼續加強打擊元朗區內賣淫等非法活動。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T03:47:52.428548+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T03:27:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T02:38:01.386602+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T03:41:14.504426+00:00","content_hash":"65db1779f257cc34b6793eda141b675ddd9cbfe399db245816d0118673486dc8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}